  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The equilibrium positions of six particles in a medium are separated by a distance of 2 cm as shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The positions of these particles, when a longitudinal wave is transmitted through the medium, are now shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the wavelength of the wave?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">2 cm</li><li data-label=\"B\">4 cm</li><li data-label=\"C\">6 cm</li><li data-label=\"D\">8 cm</li></ol>"
  },
